Lambs to the Slaugther
}

STRING 2533
{
The Gilneans were foolish enough to test our Armada on the open waters, now they flee like the cowards they are. Show them the true price of their arrogance, and send them all to the bottom of the sea!
}

STRING 2534
{
Sink the retreating Gilnean warships
}

STRING 2535
{
The Fall of Hillsbrad
}

STRING 2536
{
The time we have been waiting for has finally come! All who oppose the Horde must be taught a harsh lesson. Burn Hillsbrad to the ground - leave no one alive!
}

